# This domain's working files, none of it source:
#
#   .terraform/  Terraform's working directory: downloaded providers
#                and backend bookkeeping. The lock file
#                (.terraform.lock.hcl) is deliberately not ignored,
#                because provider versions are pins like any other
#                VERSION file here.
#   identity/    a cluster's private keys and join token; never in
#                history
#   image/       assembled install media and disk images
#   channel/     verified downloads from the release channel, cached
#                by version; redownloadable, so never source
#   flatcar/     the redirect host's Flatcar image, which `make
#                flatcar` downloads; about 550 MB, and redownloadable
#
# The liken CLI writes identity/, image/, and channel/ into a
# cluster's directory. This directory is not one, but a cluster made
# here by mistake must never reach history, the identity keys above
# all.
.terraform/
identity/
image/
channel/
flatcar/
